  prediction: "For \u2018Trip during a sustained jam\u2019, what result or observation
    would you expect if the required setup is correct? Distinguish a predicted result
    from a measured result."
  practice: "In Level 33, perform the objective \u2018Trip during a sustained jam\u2019
    in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence against: Recorded from
